"Adds lightweight scanlines with reduced darkness for 8-bit, 16-bit, and "
"PlayStation-era games."
msgstr ""
"Añade líneas de escaneo ligeras con oscuridad reducida para juegos de 8 "
"bits, 16 bits y la era de PlayStation."

